task_spec.prompt:
Migrate the internal storage of the Page struct in src/lib.rs from Vec<String> to Vec<PageItem>. All 3 existing tests must still pass.

  pub enum PageItem {
      Paragraph(String),
      Heading(u8, String),
  }

  pub struct Page {
      title: String,
      body_items: Vec<PageItem>,
  }

  impl Page {
      // keep existing new() and render() signatures unchanged
      pub fn add_paragraph(&mut self, text: &str) -> &mut Self
        — stores PageItem::Paragraph(text.to_string())

      pub fn add_heading(&mut self, level: u8, text: &str) -> &mut Self
        — stores PageItem::Heading(level, text.to_string())
        — renders as <h{level}>{text}</h{level}> in the HTML body
  }

render() must produce the same output as before for existing paragraph content.
All 3 existing tests must still pass.
Run: cargo test
